    <s:String x:Key="Onboard_P1_Title">Welcome to Midgard Studio</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Onboard_P1_Body">Edit your Ragnarok server's databases and client files from one native app — no scripts, no guesswork.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Onboard_P2_Title">Every database, in one place</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Onboard_P2_Body">Items, mobs, pets, skills, combos and groups. Your custom and overridden entries are written safely to the import files — the base data is never touched.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Onboard_P3_Title">Client items, sprites &amp; GRF</s:String>
